<title>CHINA: Trade in Crocodile, Lai Sun Gar. suspend.</title>
<headline>Trade in Crocodile, Lai Sun Gar. suspend.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-08-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trading in shares of Crocodile Garments Ltd and Lai Sun Garment (International) Ltd was suspended in the afternoon at the companies' request pending an announcement.</p>
<p>Crocodile shares rose HK$0.17 to HK$1.11 at midday with 35.39 million shares traded.</p>
<p>Lai Sun Garments shares rose HK$0.10 to HK$9.70 in midsession with 49,000 shares traded.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
</text>
